<arrangement encodinganalog="351">
<head>Arrangement
</head>
<p>The collection is arranged alphabetically and chronologically. It is boxed with MS 728 and MS 730.</p>

<p>f. 1: News-clippings related to the Hatton Ferry, Scottsville, VA, 1948-2001</p>

<p>f. 2: Notes and letters related to the Hatton Ferry, Scottsville, VA, 1984-1986</p>

<p>f. 3: Original sketch of proposed shack at the Hatton Ferry, by Floyd Johnson, 1984</p>

<p>f. 4: Photographs of a new [Hatton Ferry] boat?, 1997-1998; Slides of the Hatton Ferry (1968) and Warren Ferry (1968)
</p>
</arrangement>

